$$

### Step 2: Calculate the cost of the daisies
Jatie also bought 5 daisies, and each daisy is also priced at $6.

$$
\text{Cost of daisies} = 5 \times 6 = 30
$$

### Step 3: Calculate the total amount spent
Adding the costs of the roses and daisies gives:

$$
\text{Total cost} = 30 + 30 = 60
$$

### Final Answer:
$$
\boxed{60}
$$

