$$ 5 - 2 = 3 $$

Each of the 3 members who showed up scored 6 points. To find the total points scored, we multiply the number of members who showed up by the points each scored:

$$ 3 \times 6 = 18 $$

Thus, the total points scored by the team is $\boxed{18}$. 
